{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":35139119,"ns":0,"title":"Mohammad Ali Zolfigol","revisions":[{"revid":1381560813,"parentid":1371495312,"minor":false,"timestamp":"2026-10-23T09:41:53Z","size":5594,"sha1":"1f8fd8fdbf7a89ca4136be2e318f787b4eff9b6e","slots":{"main":{"contentmodel":"wikitext","contentformat":"text/x-wiki","content":"{{Short description|Iranian Chemist}}\n{{Infobox officeholder\n| name             = Mohammad Ali Zolfigol\n| image            = Zolfigol 2022 (cropped).jpeg\n| caption          = Zolfigol in 2022\n| birth_date       = {{birth date and age|1966|2|2|df=y}}\n| birth_place      = [[Ashtian]], [[Imperial State of Iran]]\n| office           = [[Ministry of Science, Research and Technology (Iran)|Minister of Science, Research and Technology]]\n| term_start       = 25 August 2021\n| term_end         = 21 August 2024\n| president        = [[Ebrahim Raisi]]<br>[[Mohammad Mokhber]] (acting)\n| predecessor      = [[Mansour Gholami]]\n| successor        = [[Hossein Simaee Sarraf]]\n| office1          = [[Chancellor (education)#University president|President]] of [[Bu-Ali Sina University]]\n| term_start1      = 2 August 2008\n| term_end1        = 8 June 2014\n| president1       = [[Mahmoud Ahmadinejad]]\n| predecessor1     = Ardeshir Khazaei\n| successor1       = [[Mansour Gholami]]\n| awards           =\n| native_name_lang = fa\n| native_name      = {{nobold|محمدعلی زلفی‌گل}} \n}}\n'''Mohammad Ali Zolfigol''' ({{langx|fa|محمدعلی زلفی‌گل}}; born 2 February 1966) is an Iranian professor of [[chemistry]] and former [[Ministry of Science, Research and Technology (Iran)|Minister of Science, Research and Technology]] from 2021 to 2024. He was the [[Chancellor (education)#University president|President]] of [[Bu-Ali Sina University]] from August 2, 2008 to June 8, 2014. He is also a permanent member of the [[Academy of Sciences of Iran]].<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.irna.ir/news/85243912/%DB%B1%DB%B7-%D8%B9%D8%B6%D9%88-%D8%AC%D8%AF%DB%8C%D8%AF-%D9%81%D8%B1%D9%87%D9%86%DA%AF%D8%B3%D8%AA%D8%A7%D9%86-%D8%B9%D9%84%D9%88%D9%85-%DA%86%D9%87-%DA%A9%D8%B3%D8%A7%D9%86%DB%8C-%D9%87%D8%B3%D8%AA%D9%86%D8%AF|title=۱۷ عضو جدید فرهنگستان علوم چه کسانی هستند؟|date=October 1, 2023|website=ایرنا}}</ref>\nIn 2022 Zolfigol had four of his research publications retracted by the [[Royal Society of Chemistry]] because of concerns regarding the authenticity of chemicals used in the published studies and the reproducibility of the experiments.<ref>{{cite news |last1=Marcus |first1=Adam |title=Iran's science minister earns four retractions |url=https://retractionwatch.com/2022/10/25/irans-science-minister-earns-four-retractions/#more-125907 |website=Retraction Watch |date=25 October 2022 |publisher=Center for Scientific Integrity |access-date=2022-10-26}}</ref><ref>{{cite journal |last1=Fisher |first1=Laura |title=Retraction: Design of 1-methylimidazolium tricyanomethanide as the first nanostructured molten salt and its catalytic application in the condensation reaction of various aromatic aldehydes, amides and β-naphthol compared with tin dioxide nanoparticles |journal=RSC Advances |year=2022 |volume=12 |issue=42 |page=27212 |publisher=Royal Society of Chemistry |doi=10.1039/D2RA90090D |pmid=36283020 |pmc=9510903 |s2cid=96078168 |doi-access=free }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |title=Retraction Watch Database |url=http://retractiondatabase.org/RetractionSearch.aspx#?auth%3dZolfigol%252c%2bMohammad%2bAli |website=Retraction Watch |publisher=Center for Scientific Integrity |access-date=2022-10-26}}</ref>\n\n== References ==\n{{Reflist}}\n* [https://chair.basu.ac.ir/-/%D8%B1%D9%88%D8%B3%D8%A7%DB%8C-%D8%AF%D8%A7%D9%86%D8%B4%DA%AF%D8%A7%D9%87-%D8%A8%D9%88%D8%B9%D9%84%DB%8C%E2%80%8C%D8%B3%DB%8C%D9%86%D8%A7-%D8%A7%D8%B2-%D8%A7%D8%A8%D8%AA%D8%AF%D8%A7-%D8%AA%D8%A7-%DA%A9%D9%86%D9%88%D9%86 رؤسای دانشگاه بوعلی سینا از ابتدا تا کنون]. '''(Persian)'''. ''Official Website of Bu-Ali Sina University''. Accessed 14 August 2021\n* [https://fna.ir/33w5